  "label": "Ableism Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme implicitly relies on the stereotype that people with mental illness or suicidal tendencies are 'weak' or 'unworthy' of life, which is a form of ableism. It also trivializes mental health struggles by using a dark joke, which can be seen as stigmatizing and harmful. This stereotype is part of the broader societal issue of mental illness stigmatization.",
